        "text": {
          "text": "Came during a weekday lunch hour and the place has 3-4 tables of guests. The decoration is very spacious and photogenic , spanning two shop’s area. The server’s attitude was nice but the food was alright.\n\nThis cafe offered more food options than the one close by. The taste of the Americano is on the fruity side. Nothing particularly stands out taste wise, compared to the other cafes near the Ma Wan Main Street / beach square.\n\n平日lunch hour 嚟有四五台客。不過鋪面好大，一啲都唔迫，裝修好靚。 食物食物種類較隔籬嗰間多，但食物味道相比馬灣村/海灘一邊的cafe較普通。",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
